  "sentence_placements": [
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-01",
      "text": "One Friday, the facilitator note says 'available for review.'",
      "source_start": 0.213,
      "source_end": 4.167,
      "sequence_start": 14.103,
      "sequence_end": 18.057000000000002
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-01",
      "text": "If the agent quietly treats that as permission to confirm a teacher, the map looks orderly while the work crosses a boundary.",
      "source_start": 4.352,
      "source_end": 10.745,
      "sequence_start": 18.242,
      "sequence_end": 24.634999999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-01",
      "text": "We need a permission slip someone can inspect before the next draft.",
      "source_start": 10.909,
      "source_end": 14.322,
      "sequence_start": 24.799,
      "sequence_end": 28.212
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-02",
      "text": "Chapter Nine names five fields: scope, ceiling, reversibility, escalation, and expiry.",
      "source_start": 14.749,
      "source_end": 21.597,
      "sequence_start": 28.639000000000003,
      "sequence_end": 35.487
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-02",
      "text": "For Harbor, scope is three cleared course notes and a draft brief.",
      "source_start": 21.959,
      "source_end": 25.74,
      "sequence_start": 35.849000000000004,
      "sequence_end": 39.629999999999995
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-02",
      "text": "The ceiling is preparation only.",
      "source_start": 26.065,
      "source_end": 28.177,
      "sequence_start": 39.955,
      "sequence_end": 42.067
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-02",
      "text": "The role cannot change the source notes, approve a memory, book a room, contact a facilitator, or message participants.",
      "source_start": 28.497,
      "source_end": 36.125,
      "sequence_start": 42.387,
      "sequence_end": 50.015
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-02",
      "text": "Reversibility means Morgan can withdraw or revise a draft; it does not promise that a public message could be undone.",
      "source_start": 36.457,
      "source_end": 42.878,
      "sequence_start": 50.347,
      "sequence_end": 56.768
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-02",
      "text": "Escalation names Morgan for missing or conflicting evidence.",
      "source_start": 43.07,
      "source_end": 46.375,
      "sequence_start": 56.96,
      "sequence_end": 60.265
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-02",
      "text": "Expiry sends the proposed slip back for review before the next course planning cycle.",
      "source_start": 46.778,
      "source_end": 51.407,
      "sequence_start": 60.668,
      "sequence_end": 65.297
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-03",
      "text": "The workbook asks us to place an action on an authority ladder: prepare, recommend, route, stage, execute.",
      "source_start": 51.642,
      "source_end": 59.002,
      "sequence_start": 65.53200000000001,
      "sequence_end": 72.892
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-03",
      "text": "Our role sits at prepare.",
      "source_start": 59.194,
      "source_end": 61.419,
      "sequence_start": 73.084,
      "sequence_end": 75.309
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-03",
      "text": "Its proposed slip also names permitted source IDs, forbidden inputs, the receipt, source checks, an owner, and a revocation path.",
      "source_start": 61.682,
      "source_end": 69.789,
      "sequence_start": 75.572,
      "sequence_end": 83.679
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-03",
      "text": "A source that was cleared last week may expire.",
      "source_start": 70.002,
      "source_end": 72.787,
      "sequence_start": 83.892,
      "sequence_end": 86.677
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-03",
      "text": "A rule written in a prompt is not enough for our paper design; the permission needs to be visible beside the job and decision.",
      "source_start": 73.096,
      "source_end": 80.456,
      "sequence_start": 86.986,
      "sequence_end": 94.346
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-03",
      "text": "This exercise grants no real permission.",
      "source_start": 80.862,
      "source_end": 83.272,
      "sequence_start": 94.752,
      "sequence_end": 97.162
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-04",
      "text": "Now test the value of the work itself.",
      "source_start": 83.592,
      "source_end": 85.733,
      "sequence_start": 97.482,
      "sequence_end": 99.623
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-04",
      "text": "Suppose Harbor also has a second paper role that drafts a daily weather summary for possible workshops.",
      "source_start": 86.081,
      "source_end": 91.713,
      "sequence_start": 99.971,
      "sequence_end": 105.603
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-04",
      "text": "Nobody reads it.",
      "source_start": 91.927,
      "source_end": 92.865,
      "sequence_start": 105.81700000000001,
      "sequence_end": 106.755
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-04",
      "text": "It has a clean receipt, but no decision uses it.",
      "source_start": 93.036,
      "source_end": 95.952,
      "sequence_start": 106.926,
      "sequence_end": 109.842
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-04",
      "text": "Chapter Ten calls for a Quarterly Cull: proof delivered, permission current, and would we build it again today?",
      "source_start": 96.179,
      "source_end": 103.433,
      "sequence_start": 110.069,
      "sequence_end": 117.32300000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-04",
      "text": "The session brief has a named decision and reviewer, though its value is still only a classroom hypothesis.",
      "source_start": 103.859,
      "source_end": 109.734,
      "sequence_start": 117.749,
      "sequence_end": 123.624
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-04",
      "text": "The weather summary fails the proof test.",
      "source_start": 109.977,
      "source_end": 111.982,
      "sequence_start": 123.867,
      "sequence_end": 125.872
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-04",
      "text": "In this exercise we recommend retirement for human review; we do not delete a trigger or revoke a live tool.",
      "source_start": 112.196,
      "source_end": 118.382,
      "sequence_start": 126.086,
      "sequence_end": 132.272
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-05",
      "text": "A retirement decision needs a person too.",
      "source_start": 118.596,
      "source_end": 120.758,
      "sequence_start": 132.486,
      "sequence_end": 134.648
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-05",
      "text": "If a real agent existed, a human owner would review the evidence, sign the sunset, revoke access, archive governed memory, remove triggers, and record the change.",
      "source_start": 121,
      "source_end": 131.069,
      "sequence_start": 134.89,
      "sequence_end": 144.959
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-05",
      "text": "Neglect leaves permissions behind.",
      "source_start": 131.453,
      "source_end": 133.511,
      "sequence_start": 145.34300000000002,
      "sequence_end": 147.401
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-05",
      "text": "Here, there is no running agent, no trigger, and no memory to remove.",
      "source_start": 133.904,
      "source_end": 138.533,
      "sequence_start": 147.79399999999998,
      "sequence_end": 152.423
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-05",
      "text": "Write the proposed decision and its reason.",
      "source_start": 138.853,
      "source_end": 141.307,
      "sequence_start": 152.743,
      "sequence_end": 155.197
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-05",
      "text": "Keep the external world untouched.",
      "source_start": 141.669,
      "source_end": 143.717,
      "sequence_start": 155.55900000000003,
      "sequence_end": 157.60700000000003
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-05",
      "text": "The same human discipline governs adding a capability and taking one away.",
      "source_start": 143.93,
      "source_end": 148.475,
      "sequence_start": 157.82,
      "sequence_end": 162.365
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-06",
      "text": "Pause.",
      "source_start": 148.709,
      "source_end": 149.336,
      "sequence_start": 162.599,
      "sequence_end": 163.226
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-06",
      "text": "Which line in the slip would prevent a well-written brief from turning into an unauthorized announcement?",
      "source_start": 149.706,
      "source_end": 154.89,
      "sequence_start": 163.596,
      "sequence_end": 168.77999999999997
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-07",
      "text": "Write the Permission Slip for the preparation role.",
      "source_start": 155.125,
      "source_end": 157.728,
      "sequence_start": 169.015,
      "sequence_end": 171.618
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-07",
      "text": "Include each of the five fields, its authority rung, read and write scope, retention rule, source check, receipt, approval owner, review date, and revocation path.",
      "source_start": 157.985,
      "source_end": 168.197,
      "sequence_start": 171.875,
      "sequence_end": 182.087
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-07",
      "text": "Then run the Quarterly Cull on the session brief role and the course weather-summary role.",
      "source_start": 168.51,
      "source_end": 173.417,
      "sequence_start": 182.39999999999998,
      "sequence_end": 187.30700000000002
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-07",
      "text": "Use the three tests and record keep, narrow, or retirement proposal.",
      "source_start": 173.758,
      "source_end": 178.195,
      "sequence_start": 187.64800000000002,
      "sequence_end": 192.08499999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-07",
      "text": "Use a fictional or approved example.",
      "source_start": 178.494,
      "source_end": 180.594,
      "sequence_start": 192.38400000000001,
      "sequence_end": 194.48399999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-07",
      "text": "Do not use private operational data or grant a real permission.",
      "source_start": 180.946,
      "source_end": 184.721,
      "sequence_start": 194.836,
      "sequence_end": 198.611
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-08",
      "text": "Save revision six as a draft.",
      "source_start": 185.084,
      "source_end": 186.833,
      "sequence_start": 243.97400000000002,
      "sequence_end": 245.72299999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L06-08",
      "text": "A role's permission and its reason to exist both need renewal.",
      "source_start": 187.132,
      "source_end": 190.667,
      "sequence_start": 246.02200000000002,
      "sequence_end": 249.55700000000004
    }
  ],
